# Toward a Theory and a Model for Integrating Part-Time Faculty into a Community College Humanities Division.

**Authors:** Cain, Michael Scott

## Abstract
Reviews the literature showing trends toward the increasing employment of part-time faculty at community colleges. Describes existing models for the integration of adjunct faculty into the college community. Suggests a model of systematic, ongoing, adult-to-adult communication for the integration of part-timers into a fully functioning humanities division. (DMM)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ384452

